  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together sliced plums, sugar, and cinnamon.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together flour and crumbled polish crumble.",
    "Add melted butter to the flour mixture and stir until combined.",
    "Pour the plum mixture into a 9x9 inch baking dish.",
    "Top the plum mixture with the crumble mixture.",
